__pycache__
dist/
tent_pole.egg-info/

## Generated build products under dev/sample-course/ (see its README.md)
## -- source is tracked, these are rebuilt by `make`. No secret lives in
## this directory at all: tent-pole.toml only has [module], and the
## real target/credentials come from TENT_POLE_USE_TEST_CONFIG + your
## own global tent-pole.toml's [dev] section.
dev/sample-course/*.html
dev/sample-course/*.tpp
dev/sample-course/*.tpf
dev/sample-course/*.out
dev/sample-course/*.stout
dev/sample-course/*.crash
dev/sample-course/test-image.png
dev/sample-course/test-video.mp4
